
@startuml
title Projectory - Project Creation & Management
autonumber

actor Student
participant "React Frontend" as React
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
database "PostgreSQL / Supabase" as DB

Student -> React: Open Portfolio page
Student -> React: Click New Project
React --> Student: Display creation form

Student -> React: Enter project title and description
Student -> React: Click Submit
React --> Student: Display project preview

alt Back to Editor
    Student -> React: Return to editor
    React --> Student: Display editable form
else Confirm Submission
    Student -> React: Confirm project
    React -> API: Submit project data

    API -> API: Validate project data

    alt Invalid project data
        API --> React: Return validation error
        React --> Student: Display error message
    else Valid project data
        API -> DB: Insert project record
        DB --> API: Return saved project
        API --> React: Return success response
        React --> Student: Display saved project
    end
end

@enduml
